Oh, cool.  Meanwhile, my Twitter poll ended in favor of bikeshed:

https://twitter.com/solardiz/status/783033528736940032

"What should (Linux) Kernel Self Protection Project's logo be?

32% A fancy penguin
42% A bikeshed
 7% Other (please tweet what)
